@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    AHInteriorsERP stores customer, order and product information securely and only allows authorised users to access the system based on their assigned role.
    The system is designed to protect business and customer data through authentication, role-based access control and secure password management.
    Any data stored within the system is used only for business operations such as order processing, stock management and invoicing.
</p>
